{"project_id":"proj_001","title":"春日轨道 第一章","author":"演示","characters":{"heroine":{"character_id":"heroine","name":"雨宫白","role":"protagonist","description":"一个安静但敏锐的学生，习惯坐在教室窗边读小说。","traits":["安静","敏锐","有点固执"],"color":"#88ccff","asset_ids":{"neutral":"sprite_heroine_neutral","happy":"sprite_heroine_happy","sad":"sprite_heroine_sad","shy":"sprite_heroine_shy","surprised":"sprite_heroine_surprised"}},"rival":{"character_id":"rival","name":"朱雀茜","role":"supporting","description":"严谨的学生会长，说话做事都很利落，其实比外表温柔。","traits":["严格","能干","不太坦率"],"color":"#ff6688","asset_ids":{"neutral":"sprite_rival_neutral","angry":"sprite_rival_angry"}},"friend":{"character_id":"friend","name":"朝日奈奈","role":"supporting","description":"女主角开朗的同班同学，总是在不经意间替她打气。","traits":["开朗","话多","热心"],"color":"#ffcc44","asset_ids":{"neutral":"sprite_friend_neutral","happy":"sprite_friend_happy"}}},"scenes":{"scene_gate":{"scene_id":"scene_gate","title":"樱花校门","description":"新学期第一个早晨，校门口发生的一次相遇。","background_id":"bg_sakura_path","nodes":{"s1_narr_start":{"type":"narration","node_id":"s1_narr_start","text":"春天的清晨，校门口的樱花在风里缓缓飘落。新学期第一天，空气里有花粉和刚擦过黑板的味道，也有一点说不清的新鲜感。","next_node_id":"s1_dialogue_friend","background_id":"bg_sakura_path"},"s1_dialogue_friend":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s1_dialogue_friend","character_id":"friend","text":"早啊，小白！你看起来又没睡醒，昨晚是不是又熬夜看书了？","emotion":"happy","side":"right","next_node_id":"s1_dialogue_heroine_1"},"s1_dialogue_heroine_1":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s1_dialogue_heroine_1","character_id":"heroine","text":"……嗯。把小说最后一章看完了，一不小心就忘了时间。","emotion":"neutral","side":"left","next_node_id":"s1_dialogue_friend_2"},"s1_dialogue_friend_2":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s1_dialogue_friend_2","character_id":"friend","text":"哈哈，真像你。对了，你知道吗？学生会长今天好像在找你。","emotion":"neutral","side":"right","next_node_id":"s1_dialogue_heroine_2"},"s1_dialogue_heroine_2":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s1_dialogue_heroine_2","character_id":"heroine","text":"……找我？我最近应该没做什么会被训的事吧。","emotion":"neutral","side":"left","next_node_id":"s1_choice"},"s1_choice":{"type":"choice","node_id":"s1_choice","text":"听到这句话，你想：","options":[{"option_id":"s1_opt_worry","text":"有点不安……我最近没惹什么麻烦吧？","next_node_id":"s1_dialogue_heroine_worry","condition":null,"effects":{"anxiety":1}},{"option_id":"s1_opt_curious","text":"学生会长找我？倒是有点意思。","next_node_id":"s1_dialogue_heroine_curious","condition":null,"effects":{"anxiety":-1,"confidence":1}}]},"s1_dialogue_heroine_worry":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s1_dialogue_heroine_worry","character_id":"heroine","text":"……奈奈，你知道是为了什么吗？至少给我一点心理准备。","emotion":"shy","side":"left","next_node_id":"s1_dialogue_friend_3"},"s1_dialogue_heroine_curious":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s1_dialogue_heroine_curious","character_id":"heroine","text":"那就让她来找我吧。反正我也没什么好躲的。","emotion":"neutral","side":"left","next_node_id":"s1_dialogue_friend_3"},"s1_dialogue_friend_3":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s1_dialogue_friend_3","character_id":"friend","text":"具体我也不知道啦。不过看她的表情，应该不是坏事！我先去教室了，祝你好运~","emotion":"happy","side":"right","next_node_id":"s1_narr_rival_enters"},"s1_narr_rival_enters":{"type":"narration","node_id":"s1_narr_rival_enters","text":"奈奈挥挥手，快步跑远。你刚准备往前走，身后忽然传来一道清亮的声音。","next_node_id":"s1_dialogue_rival","background_id":"bg_sakura_path"},"s1_dialogue_rival":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s1_dialogue_rival","character_id":"rival","text":"你就是雨宫白吧。我是学生会长朱雀茜。可以占用你五分钟吗？","emotion":"neutral","side":"right","next_node_id":"s1_end"},"s1_end":{"type":"scene_transition","node_id":"s1_end","target_scene_id":"scene_classroom","effect":"fade","next_node_id":null}}},"scene_classroom":{"scene_id":"scene_classroom","title":"空教室","description":"与学生会长之间一场直接而意外的谈话。","background_id":"bg_classroom","nodes":{"s2_narr_classroom":{"type":"narration","node_id":"s2_narr_classroom","text":"空教室里，你们隔着一张课桌面对面坐下。窗外传来运动社团的口号声，午后的光落在桌沿上。","next_node_id":"s2_dialogue_rival_1","background_id":"bg_classroom"},"s2_dialogue_rival_1":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s2_dialogue_rival_1","character_id":"rival","text":"我就直说了。我希望你加入学生会。","emotion":"neutral","side":"right","next_node_id":"s2_dialogue_heroine_1"},"s2_dialogue_heroine_1":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s2_dialogue_heroine_1","character_id":"heroine","text":"……欸？","emotion":"surprised","side":"left","next_node_id":"s2_dialogue_rival_2"},"s2_dialogue_rival_2":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s2_dialogue_rival_2","character_id":"rival","text":"我看过你的资料。成绩很好，文字能力也强。去年校报上那篇获奖文章，我也读过。","emotion":"neutral","side":"right","next_node_id":"s2_dialogue_rival_3"},"s2_dialogue_rival_3":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s2_dialogue_rival_3","character_id":"rival","text":"学生会需要一名书记。与其找一个只想刷履历的人，我更想找真正能做事的人。","emotion":"neutral","side":"right","next_node_id":"s2_dialogue_heroine_2"},"s2_dialogue_heroine_2":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s2_dialogue_heroine_2","character_id":"heroine","text":"……被你看过资料这件事有点微妙。不过，我好像也没有拒绝的理由。","emotion":"shy","side":"left","next_node_id":"s2_dialogue_rival_4"},"s2_dialogue_rival_4":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s2_dialogue_rival_4","character_id":"rival","text":"那就这么定了。明天放学后来学生会室报到，不要迟到。","emotion":"neutral","side":"right","next_node_id":"s2_narr_end"},"s2_narr_end":{"type":"narration","node_id":"s2_narr_end","text":"朱雀茜站起身，制服裙摆划出利落的弧线。她走到门口，又短暂停了一下。","next_node_id":"s2_dialogue_rival_final","background_id":"bg_classroom"},"s2_dialogue_rival_final":{"type":"dialogue","node_id":"s2_dialogue_rival_final","character_id":"rival","text":"——我期待你的表现。","emotion":"neutral","side":"right","next_node_id":"s2_choice"},"s2_choice":{"type":"choice","node_id":"s2_choice","text":"她的身影消失在门外。你想：","options":[{"option_id":"s2_opt_positive","text":"……好像也不坏。新学期就当作新的开始吧。","next_node_id":"s2_ending_positive","condition":null,"effects":{"confidence":1,"rival_relation":1}},{"option_id":"s2_opt_negative","text":"真麻烦……希望不要占掉我看书的时间。","next_node_id":"s2_ending_neutral","condition":null,"effects":{"anxiety":1}}]},"s2_ending_positive":{"type":"ending","node_id":"s2_ending_positive","ending_type":"neutral","epilogue":"就这样，你成了学生会书记。看来这个春天的校园生活，不会太无聊。"},"s2_ending_neutral":{"type":"ending","node_id":"s2_ending_neutral","ending_type":"neutral","epilogue":"你叹了口气，收拾书包离开教室。图书馆还开着，至少今晚还能把那本小说读完。"}}}},"start_scene_id":"scene_gate","variables":[{"name":"anxiety","type":"int","default":0,"description":"女主角的不安"},{"name":"confidence","type":"int","default":0,"description":"女主角的自信"},{"name":"rival_relation","type":"int","default":0,"description":"与学生会长的关系"}],"asset_resources":{"bg_school_gate":{"id":"bg_school_gate","url":"/assets/bg_school_gate.png","asset_type":"background","character_id":null,"emotion":null,"generator":"placeholder","seed":null,"width":1920,"height":1080},"bg_classroom":{"id":"bg_classroom","url":"/assets/bg_classroom.png","asset_type":"background","character_id":null,"emotion":null,"generator":"placeholder","seed":null,"width":1920,"height":1080},"bg_rooftop":{"id":"bg_rooftop","url":"/assets/bg_rooftop.png","asset_type":"background","character_id":null,"emotion":null,"generator":"placeholder","seed":null,"width":1920,"height":1080},"bg_sakura_path":{"id":"bg_sakura_path","url":"/assets/bg_sakura_path.png","asset_type":"background","character_id":null,"emotion":null,"generator":"placeholder","seed":null,"width":1920,"height":1080},"sprite_heroine_neutral":{"id":"sprite_heroine_neutral","url":"/assets/heroine_neutral.png","asset_type":"character_sprite","character_id":"heroine","emotion":"neutral","generator":"placeholder","seed":null,"width":1920,"height":1080},"sprite_heroine_happy":{"id":"sprite_heroine_happy","url":"/assets/heroine_happy.png","asset_type":"character_sprite","character_id":"heroine","emotion":"happy","generator":"placeholder","seed":null,"width":1920,"height":1080},"sprite_heroine_sad":{"id":"sprite_heroine_sad","url":"/assets/heroine_sad.png","asset_type":"character_sprite","character_id":"heroine","emotion":"sad","generator":"placeholder","seed":null,"width":1920,"height":1080},"sprite_heroine_shy":{"id":"sprite_heroine_shy","url":"/assets/heroine_shy.png","asset_type":"character_sprit